    LLM: "Bid based on your hand strength and trump holding. With a weak hand, bid low (0 or 1). With strong trumps, bid more aggressively.\n\nThe dealer restriction is keyâ€”if you're dealer, you may be forced into a difficult bid. Watch other bids and calculate what you're allowed to bid. Zero bids can be very effective with weak hands.\n\nCard counting to track what's been played. Calculate probabilities of opponents' holdings based on their bids and play. In later rounds with fewer cards, exact calculation becomes possible.",
